  5 ...
  Charlie went to Savory Group meeting Andrew and Shauna Smith in Salt
  Lake City the morning of his death. We had the Toyotas from 19th
  Mountain National Guard team going down University Parkway to
  converge on Savor's Swig near BYU stadium for the escape. The DQ next
  to Swig could have been the place where some of the Toyotas stopped.
